# Compiled Go binaries. `go build ./...` in the repo root drops api.exe and
# worker.exe; a committed binary is both large and unreviewable.
/api
/api.exe
/worker
/worker.exe
*.exe

# Redirected process output, the usual result of launching the API or a
# frontend with Start-Process -RedirectStandardOutput.
/*.out
/*.err
